sentences.text:
4/ The impugned judgment of conviction and order of sentence is assailed in present appeal on following grounds:-
i) Learned trial court convicted the appellant merely on conjecture and surmise and on the basis of mere suspicion stated by prosecution witness;
ii) Learned trial court completely ignored the defence version which was supported by prosecution witness;
iii) Learned trial court convicted the appellant merely on statement of parents of deceased.

There were material contradiction and inconsistency in their statement;
iv) Deceased had committed suicide due to embarrassment caused by incident happened at the marriage at village Barkheda;
v) Learned trial court committed error in convicting the appellant.
